        "CustomOutputName": "Privacy note",
        "WFCommentActionText": "No embedded endpoint or credential. Accept exactly one supplied PNG/JPEG and optional manually typed question. No shared text, OCR or EXIF is used as a question. No image conversion/resizing. Ask for upload-only code at runtime; the input may be visible. Never enter owner/read/OpenAI/Tunnel credentials. This template does not store the code or use clipboard. The OS/source app may supply an exported representation. Inbox expiry and persistent Space attachments are separate. iPhone acceptance is still required."
